# THE SELF-HOSTED RUNNER, WHICH IS A TOOL AND NOT SOURCE. It is being installed here to get
# around Actions refusing to start jobs on a billing limit. Untracked was not enough: the lint
# group reads every file git does not ignore, so GitHub's own runner source turned up as 56
# errors and blocked a push — and it grows as the install proceeds, so the count kept changing.
